### remote-controller（默认 127.0.0.1:3100）
### 环境变量：REMOTE_ENROLL_TOKEN / REMOTE_ADMIN_TOKEN / REMOTE_PORT
### WebSocket 代理入口 WS /v1/agent?id=… 不在本文件覆盖

### 健康检查
# @name remoteHealth
GET {{remoteBase}}/v1/health

### Agent 注册
# @name remoteEnroll
POST {{remoteBase}}/v1/enroll
Authorization: Bearer {{remoteEnrollToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "rest-client-agent"
}

### Agent 列表（admin）
# @name remoteAgents
GET {{remoteBase}}/v1/agents
Authorization: Bearer {{remoteAdminToken}}

### Agent 详情
# @name remoteAgentGet
GET {{remoteBase}}/v1/agents/{{agentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{remoteAdminToken}}

### 删除 Agent
# @name remoteAgentDelete
DELETE {{remoteBase}}/v1/agents/{{agentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{remoteAdminToken}}

### 列出任务
# @name remoteTasksList
GET {{remoteBase}}/v1/agents/{{agentId}}/tasks?limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{remoteAdminToken}}

### 按状态过滤任务
# @name remoteTasksFilter
GET {{remoteBase}}/v1/agents/{{agentId}}/tasks?status=queued&limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{remoteAdminToken}}

### 下发 status
# @name remoteTaskStatus
POST {{remoteBase}}/v1/agents/{{agentId}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{remoteAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "status"
}

### 下发 start（service: bds | db | qq | llbot）
# @name remoteTaskStart
POST {{remoteBase}}/v1/agents/{{agentId}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{remoteAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "start",
  "service": "db"
}

### 下发 stop
# @name remoteTaskStop
POST {{remoteBase}}/v1/agents/{{agentId}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{remoteAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "stop",
  "service": "db"
}

### 下发 restart
# @name remoteTaskRestart
POST {{remoteBase}}/v1/agents/{{agentId}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{remoteAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "restart",
  "service": "bds"
}

### 下发 send（需 message）
# @name remoteTaskSend
POST {{remoteBase}}/v1/agents/{{agentId}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{remoteAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "send",
  "message": "hello from REST Client"
}

### 查询单个任务
# @name remoteTaskGet
GET {{remoteBase}}/v1/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{remoteAdminToken}}
